It should keep parameters on style tags
{% style what %}
{% endstyle %}

It should keep parameters on javascript tags
{% javascript what %}
{% endjavascript %}

It should strip arguments from else tags
{% if cond %}{% else what %}{% endif %}

It should strip arguments from break tags
{% break what %}

It should strip arguments from continue tags
{% continue what %}

It should strip arguments from comment tags
{% comment what %}
hi
{% endcomment %}
{% comment what %}
{% endcomment %}

It should keep parameters on raw tags
{% raw what %}{% endraw %}
